    "text": "A combination of parallel plate capacitors is maintained at a certain potential difference.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fc487d05-51c7-4afd-b503-c403da98ee71-image.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 102px;\" /><br /><br />When a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math> thick slab is introduced between all the plates, in order to maintain the same potential difference, the distance between the plates is increased by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>. Find the dielectric constant of the slab.",
